<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\The_Covert.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> had gone out after </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">her mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I couldn't leave </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> behind.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, let's go sleep in a futon, okay? You'll get all sore sleeping here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Mm... nn... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, don't leave me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I wanna sleep with you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'm scared..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">All right, then..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家布団.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Together with </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I got into the futon next to the one </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was sleeping in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> had held </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> in her arms to get her to sleep, I tried to get </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to sleep, holding her in my arms.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">―The whole time, I kept thinking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This case really isn't a curse after all. There's human intent at work in it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A lot of it looks like coincidence, but the culprit is acting with everything in view.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And not by running things on a single plan, either. The culprit has made plans for every pattern, so as to be ready for whatever happens.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Or else, a person sharp enough to respond at once to anything at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And a despicable person, who hems people in psychologically and has others carry out the plan without ever lifting a finger.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">By this point, I had put together a certain hypothesis.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro Niimura</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Vague as it is, it's almost certain: </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">this man</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is the culprit.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1"> said, people trust him, and he's smart.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That alone is more than enough to fit the picture of the culprit.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> hasn't laid a hand on anyone, and there's probably no evidence, either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">On top of that, it's hard to believe he gave the actual killers any direct instructions.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Through extremely clever psychological steering, he's moving other people however he likes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Yes, a method that's extremely clever, and despicable at the same time.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\呪いイメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I hate this kind of criminal more than any other.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They do nothing themselves, treat other people like game pieces, make them kill each other, and get what they want.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is the culprit, I'll never forgive him...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Whatever it takes, I'll catch him out and get him to the police...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家布団.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> clung to me tightly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"There, there. Nothing to be scared of..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I gave </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s head a </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="な">pat</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has scared </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">his own daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> this badly. What on earth is he trying to do...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> got caught, what would happen to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Her mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is already dead, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would have no parents left.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, too: there's no telling how many more years she can live.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then would </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> end up looking after </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">After finally getting out to Tokyo, she'd be dragged back here by family circumstances.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">However things fall, nothing changes the fact that </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will be hurt.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I hugged </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> tight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Already half asleep, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> spoke in a small voice.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, it's okay. You don't have to worry about anything..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> closed her eyes again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">How close can I get to the culprit?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> isn't proven to be the culprit, but even so, I'll build up my reasoning on that assumption, little by little.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This culprit who stays ahead of the other side's thinking at every turn, this </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="こうかつ">cunning</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, despicable culprit... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm going to reach them, no matter what!</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">What...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, it can't be...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In that moment, something horrifying came into my head.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Could it be... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">that even my thinking this is part of the culprit's calculations?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If even this deduction is part of a plan the culprit foresaw, one step ahead of me...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has been suspected of being the culprit by people in the past as well, it seems.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But however much they checked, no evidence turned up, and on top of that the curse-killings went on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The people who suspected him were dancing to the culprit's tune in the end, too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If so, no matter how much I build up my reasoning, I can never know where the culprit's expectations begin and end.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Am I in the palm of the culprit's hand right now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If so, with my state of mind gripped this cleverly, I'll never reach the truth, however long I try...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Or is even my noticing that I'm in the palm of the culprit's hand exactly what the culprit imagined?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is going around in circles! However far I think it through, I don't feel like I'll ever get there...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then, a method the culprit could never think of...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> isn't settled as the culprit, but even so, it's enough to work with as a hypothesis.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Besides, just noticing that I may be in the culprit's hand is big progress.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I'll keep that firmly in mind as I build up my reasoning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is the culprit. Assuming that...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">First, back to basics.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A crime always has a purpose.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">9 years of curse-killings should be nothing more than a means.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Because the curse-killings are still going on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That means either the purpose hasn't been achieved yet, or killing </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents was the purpose.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With the purpose this unclear, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> must be hiding it in some clever way.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">And in these curse-killings, the candidates for the 'setup' in kishotenketsu are far too many. [TN: Kishotenketsu: four parts, ki 'setup', sho 'development', ten 'twist', ketsu 'conclusion'.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Not every strange thing that happened necessarily ties into the curse-killings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So, first the purpose―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">it makes sense to start from the 'conclusion.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Work the scenario out backward, and find the 'setup' from there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's the only method I have right now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If I were </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, what would I have done?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If we were getting close to the truth, I would definitely put in some misdirection.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\起承転結.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">For example, the kishotenketsu of the curse-killings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A crime has a purpose, and only then do the means and the action, in other words the 'setup,' come about.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If I were the culprit, that's where I'd put in misdirection.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Thinking from the 'setup' only applies to mystery novels.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Because readers are only ever given the scenario in kishotenketsu order.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For the culprit, it always runs from the 'conclusion' to the 'setup.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And the 'twist'―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">a situation that takes a sudden turn must never, ever happen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The textbook way to commit a crime is, if possible, 'setup and conclusion' only, or at worst 'setup, development and conclusion' only.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, thinking in kishotenketsu plays right into the culprit's hands.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kishotenketsu is just how a story is built. For the culprit, the 'conclusion' is all that's needed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So here I'll think only about the 'conclusion,' and think about the 'setup' once the 'conclusion' is settled.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">For now, let me assume that killing </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents was the 'conclusion.'</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\血しぶき背景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents, then. If killing them is the purpose, what would the motive be?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">One possibility: in connection with the Megasawa affair 10 years ago, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> died, and he resented </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents, who set it off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But if that's why he wanted to kill them, the method is too roundabout.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In that case, all he'd have to do is get </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents to attend the thirteenth-year memorial service. [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Oh, the reason they didn't come to the thirteenth-year memorial service was </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s advice, wasn't it...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If so, then ignoring </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s warning and coming near the settlement was a mistake after all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If he noticed from some clue that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents had come here...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Then, give some trigger to residents ruled by distrust, and what happened earlier would follow.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Right. As a theory, it fits, more or less.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Keeping the curse-killings going for as long as 9 years was a way to keep planting distrust in the residents, while psychologically steering </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> into asking </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents for help.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Committing the crime outside the settlement would surely be hard.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">That's why </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> doesn't lay a hand on anyone himself, and the people around him commit the crime with nothing but a trigger from him―it took 9 years to bring things to that state.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But even so, that's too big a leap.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even if the first curse-killing 9 years ago was done by </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, or by a resident </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> talked into it, pulling it off without getting caught is a stretch.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It would be different if, say, he had the power to see the future...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Thinking from this supernatural angle goes against my principles.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Something like precognition...</STYLE><PG>
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Precognition...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">What am I saying...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But there is someone...! Right near me, there's someone who has precognition...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has a precognition that works only at this time of year.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There's no saying she's the only person in the world with this ability.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">From what I've heard...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\血しぶき背景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供血.gal" "NORMAL" "5" "100" "5" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\栄一郎死亡.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="13">Niimura-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> died, and when he did, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was drenched in his blood. After that, she awakened to that ability.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, if he once had a chance to be drenched in blood the same way...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The causal link between the blood and the ability is unknown, but if this assumption is right, it explains everything...!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If so, there's no way an ordinary person could ever reach a truth like this! No wonder the incidents only happen in April!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> abused that ability, even something like this shouldn't be impossible.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\未必の故意.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, as 'reckless intent,' it should be possible to set a </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="わな">trap</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> so that the target of a curse-killing dies, or to egg someone on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Because </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s ability is 'sensing danger to people.'</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Use it in reverse, and you can put people in danger!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">That much is my first hypothesis, the case where </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents were the final goal.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I need to test a different angle as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Besides... possible as it is, it's a bit too much of a leap.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The method is roundabout after all, and it needs the condition '</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> has precognition.'</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Then let's suppose killing </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s parents wasn't the purpose.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In that case, what on earth was the real purpose?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Suppose all the information I need is already here...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kikyo-san's month of death, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">the many suicides, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">the curse-killings, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">the Megasawa affair, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s death.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Come to think of it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'd forgotten about that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The drug that was supposedly almost used 10 years ago.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ドローガ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I can't see it being an important factor, but it's a special drug unique to Arata, so it might be worth starting from there.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Does everyone in Arata know the drug exists?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is said to have sent it, in which case </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> must know about it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">And </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> must know about it as well.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">To begin with, by what principle does this even act on the human body?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There's no way a magic drug that ignores every principle exists in this world.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">By some principle or other, it must take the brain's limiter off.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Earlier, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> mentioned 'strength you only find in an emergency.'</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\アドレナリンイメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">If I remember right, the principle was that large amounts of adrenaline and noradrenaline are released, strongly activating the sympathetic nerves and dulling the muscle limiter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A drug that makes that possible on the spot―should I think of it as a kind of so-called doping drug?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">But if </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> sent it to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, then far from stopping the murders, it would spur them on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That's it... earlier, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> realized that and tried to ask </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, but he was killed right after.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Which means the culprit didn't want us to learn the details of the drug?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I knew it! </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> didn't send the drug. The culprit must have secretly slipped it in with the supplies!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The curse-killings and the Megasawa City affair are connected!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">On top of that, the culprit even sent a note on how to use the drug.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That means the culprit tried to get someone to kill people in Megasawa.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But I can't see the purpose of that.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">To begin with, why did </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> send weapons?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> both testified to it, so there's little doubt that </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> sent the weapons.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For example, maybe... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">she wanted the weapons and Noh masks turned into money to live on?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is who I should have asked about that in more detail.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">The ones targeted in Megasawa were two elementary school kids with no connection to either </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I can't imagine it was a personal grudge, and sympathy for </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would be an obvious contradiction.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">But still, even in this case, the odds that </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is the culprit go up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Because </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> went to </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> about killing in Megasawa, this hypothesis doesn't hold unless </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> let it slip to someone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">So the culprit is someone </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> would likely tell―in other words, her husband, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Say, for example, the two of them had a conversation like this―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Welcome back, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. Why'd you go to Megasawa, of all places?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"The truth is―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I see. So </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> wants the two elementary school kids..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Yes, but of course I stopped her. I can't do anything against the law or the </STYLE><STYLE ID="16" RUBY="おきて">rules</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah, I think that's right. </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you made the right call."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">If that's how it went, then getting </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to commit murder was the purpose in itself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If a murder happened in Megasawa, what would </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> even gain from it...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This really is starting to scramble my head...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">However far I go, I can't reach the culprit's purpose.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家布団.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I want to hear from someone, but I can't leave </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> and the others</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and I don't think these two have any important information.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">But... I want anything at all that gives me more to think with.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, please wake up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="たた">roused</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> the two of them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I don't like waking people by force, but in an emergency like this, it can't be helped.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Even truly </STYLE><STYLE ID="18" RUBY="ささい">trivial</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> information would do.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I want information to think with.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
